{"articleNo":"475632","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=475632&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2024학년도 1학기 고졸 후학습자 장학사업(희망사다리II유형) 신규장학생 신청 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.03.06","hit":"6005","attachments":[{"name":"2024년 고졸 후학습자 장학사업 카드뉴스.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=475632&attachNo=132178"},{"name":"붙임2. 2024년 고졸 후학습자 장학금 신규신청 매뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=475632&attachNo=132179"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학기&nbsp;<b>고졸 후학습자 장학사업</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">희망사다리&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">II</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">신규장학생 신청 안내드리오니 많은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 14.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;대한민국 국적자로 최종학력이 고졸이며, 성적 및 재직요건을 충족한 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">성적기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">직전학기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">점 만점의&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">70</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">점 이상</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 재직요건: 심사일 기준 재직기간이&nbsp;<b>2년 이상</b>(단, 현재 중소·중견기업 재직자는&nbsp;<b>1년 이상</b>)이며, 심사일 기준 장학생 선발 대상기업에&nbsp;<b>재직 중</b>인 자<br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2024<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. 3. 6.(수) ~ 3. 15.(금) 18:00까지</span></span><b style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span></b>&nbsp;에서 학생 직접 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">현 재직기업 유형 및 규모에 따라 차등 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ❍&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">중소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">중견기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">등록금 전액</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ❍&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">비영리기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">등록금의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">50%</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">의무사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 수혜 후 일정기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">수혜학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">×4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">재직상태 유지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">재직상태 미 이행시 장학금 반환 및 환수 절차 진행.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 고졸 후학습자 장학사업 카드뉴스 1부.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 고졸 후학습자 장학사업 학생 신청 매뉴얼 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
